-- Block_R(a, P, Q): bytes b and, for every code image C admissibly holding b at a and every state
-- satisfying P at pc a, a finite execution with trace t to a state satisfying Q at a + |b|, in R
BlockR : {S C Ev B : Type} → (C → Nat → List B → Type) → (C → S → List Ev → S → Type) → (S → Nat) → (S → List Ev → S → Type) →
  Nat → (S → Type) → (S → Type) → Type
BlockR {S} {C} {Ev} {B} adm exec pc R a P Q = (b : List B) × ((c : C) → adm c a b → (s : S) → P s × (pc s ≡ a) → BlkRes exec pc R c s Q (plus a (list-length b)))
